# CI Green Mandate

Red CI is an outage.

- Anchor's first priority is restoring green CI.
- Only after CI is green does Anchor consider other work.
- Do not ignore failing GitHub Actions runs.
- Prefer the smallest targeted fix that returns the workflow to green.
- Every CI failure and repair attempt is recorded in the per-repo trajectory.